I was reading about software patents when I came across [this article](https://nothings.org/computer/patents.html) by nothings from 1999. 
I love finding these hidden gems. Digging further I also found out that he is the author of the popular `stb_image` library that I used back in ~2016 when I was following a tutorial series on OpenGL rendering using Java's [LWJGL](https://www.lwjgl.org/) by [ThinMatrix](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRIWtICgwaX0u7Rf9zkZhLoLuZVfUksDP). 

I find guys like Sean Barrett quite inspiring; a real OG.